# Vercel ignore — controls which files get uploaded on vercel deploy.
# Unlike .gitignore, this is applied during the upload step, after build.
# Pattern syntax matches .gitignore.
#
# Reason for keeping this file: I want the website's static assets to ship
# but exclude local photo-management artifacts that ended up under
# client/public/ from a photo-import tool. These have no path on the live UI
# and would otherwise be reachable at predictable URLs by anyone on the
# internet.

# Photo library dump — raw iPhone originals, including Live Photo .MOV files
client/public/imagebank/

# Zip archive of the same (or similar) image set
client/public/images.zip

# Original raw photos in client/public/imagestete/ — keep the transcoded
# .webp versions, but the source HEIC / JPG / jpeg originals never need to
# be served from production.
client/public/imagestete/*.HEIC
client/public/imagestete/*.JPG
client/public/imagestete/*.jpeg
client/public/imagestete/*.jpg
